author: "harness:codex"
acceptance_criteria: "Retain all six operations, ten default samples, real fixture isolation and unchanged latency/RSS ratchets; optimize or partition fixture setup to fit the existing 30-second policy; retain timeout and retry evidence."
parent: pm-yse5dt
severity: medium
resolution: Move the default ten-sample contract into its own test and verify all sixty-six warmup/sample workspaces are distinct with ten measured samples per operation.
expected_result: Explicit and default sampling contracts retain their full fixture workload without sharing one aggregate test deadline.
actual_result: "Thirteen focused tests, ESLint and duplication scans pass; the original release CI passed unchanged on attempt 2. Hosted follow-up validation will exercise the separated tests on Windows before merge."
component: Test fixture efficiency
